# potentially containing secrets.
#
# `.env*` is denied by default rather than named file by file. The blueprint's
# `.env.development` used to be tracked here; it existed to force NODE_ENV for
# `vite build --mode=test`, a mode this repo never runs, and removing it leaves
# the suite at 136/136. Whatever lands next to it would have been committed by
# default — hence the wildcard. Add an explicit `!` exception, with a reason,
# if a committed env file ever earns its place.
*.local
.env*

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
